                                                "sense_id": "b60a9d01-c97e-3b9f-a5e7-fab69d90f1bf",
                                                "text": "Some U.S. banks are cutting back their dealings with embassies and other foreign institutions in the United States because of the difficulty of complying with money-laundering rules, the Wall Street Journal reported."
